{
  "title": "Condition Caveats & Indentation Rules",
  "subtitle": "Avoiding Common Syntax & Logic Traps",
  "topic": "4.1 • INDENTATION & CAVEATS",
  "body": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; width: 100%;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px; width: 100%;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #111111; padding: 4px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">\n      4.1 • Syntax Rules\n    </div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      Indentation & <hlt>Caveats</hlt>\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #222222; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 640px;\">\n      Python relies on exact spacing to know which lines belong inside a condition. Mastering these rules prevents the most common beginner errors!\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background: #fca5a5; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #111111; border-radius: 4px; padding: 20px;\">\n    <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111111; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #111111; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n      Critical Pitfall 1: = vs ==\n    </span>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 10px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      Assignment vs Equality Check\n    </h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.5;\">\n      • Single equals <hlt>=</hlt> means <strong>ASSIGNMENT</strong> (put a value into a variable box).<br/>\n      • Double equals <hlt>==</hlt> means <strong>EQUALITY CHECK</strong> (ask if both sides are equal).\n    </p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: #fee2e2; border: 2px solid #ef4444; padding: 12px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px;\">\n        <strong style=\"color: #b91c1c;\">WRONG:</strong><br/>\n        if score = 100:<br/>\n        <span style=\"color: #7f1d1d;\"># SyntaxError: invalid syntax</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background: #dcfce7; border: 2px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px;\">\n        <strong style=\"color: #15803d;\">CORRECT:</strong><br/>\n        if score == 100:<br/>\n        <span style=\"color: #14532d;\"># Compares score with 100</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background: #c4b5fd; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #111111; border-radius: 4px; padding: 20px;\">\n    <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111111; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #111111; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n      Critical Pitfall 2: The Colon & 4-Space Indent\n    </span>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 10px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      The Anatomy of an if Block\n    </h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.5;\">\n      Every <code>if</code> line must end with a colon <code>:</code>. Every line that should run when the condition is true must be indented by exactly <strong>4 spaces</strong>.\n    </p>\n    <div style=\"background: #0d1117; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #111111; padding: 14px; font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; color: #f0f6fc; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 4px;\">\n      logged_in = <span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">True</span><br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">if</span> logged_in:<br/>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Welcome to your Dashboard!\"</span>)  <span style=\"color: #8b949e;\"># Indented (inside if)</span><br/>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Loading user profile...\"</span>)        <span style=\"color: #8b949e;\"># Indented (inside if)</span><br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Footer rendered.\"</span>)                      <span style=\"color: #8b949e;\"># Outside if: always runs</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
}